{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_210","type":"agent_message","text":"Most direct disclosures occur late in the story: the median first mention is about 90% of the way through the text. The published study reported no literal disclosures, so our run differs materially from it. The mechanistic tests will examine secret representations at early, middle, and late positions, then test whether a targeted edit changes disclosure without harming readability."}}
