{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_239","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"pwd; cat >> notes/planning_history.md <<'EOF'\n\n### Post hoc diagnosis of failed representation gate\nThe fixed raw layer-32/token-256 probe fitted training contexts almost perfectly but achieved 8.9% held-out accuracy, failing the predeclared >20% gate. The intervention stage therefore recorded \"'`proceed:false`; no story ablations or online traces were generated. Offline target projection increased reserved-context decode accuracy rather than selectively erasing identity. Do not override either failure.\nTo diagnose contextual nuisance, center each known narrative'\"'s 15 counterfactual residuals by their unlabeled mean, fit on training contexts and evaluate held-out contexts. This uses a set of test states rather than one deployable state and is explicitly transductive/post hoc. Report the fixed layer-32 grid at all three positions and all three conditions with shuffled-label controls, not a selected peak. Strong centered decoding establishes conditional information, not a usable global direction or behavioral causation. Original probe grid, free-story associations, and D3 gate remain unchanged.\nEOF\nsource .venv/bin/activate; python src/state_note.py 'Phase 4 primary pipeline finished: all stories, judgments, plot/quality diagnostics, controlled residual extraction (1080x3x3x3840) and396 free-story replays exist. Exact smoke replay4/4. Raw fixed decoder8.9% vs6.7% chance fails20% gate; D3 honestly NOT RUN, gate artifact recorded. Reserved-context target projection worsens selectivity (decode13.3%->35%), so no erasure claim. Post hoc context-centered counterfactual probe reaches82-91% baseline across sampled positions but requires15 states per context; original gate unchanged. Secondary choice-logit measurement running, then Phase5 consolidate statistics/figures and deterministic analysis replay; Phase6 REPORT/README/validation. Main word signal largely literal disclosures; plot effects unresolved. Details/corrections in notes/planning_history.md.'\ntail -3 logs/choice_likelihood.log\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
